{"at":"2026-02-26T01:50:04.841Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":631,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listings/editing-existing-listings/","title":"Editing existing listings","description":null,"body":"<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\"><h1>Editing existing listings</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\"><br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9658\" class=\"elementor elementor-9658\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9434fcb e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9434fcb\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ac1a6ce elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ac1a6ce\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>It very easy to edit your listings on PropertyList.es. Admins can edit all properties, only agents with the set permissions can edit all properties. <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/your-account/managing-user-permissions-and-access-levels/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Find out how to set permissions here.</a></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e1cfe15 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e1cfe15\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-24fa1cb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"24fa1cb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>You can edit your listing in various ways but the most straight forward is:</p><ul><li>Click “MY LISTINGS”&nbsp;</li><li>Find the property you want to edit.</li><li>Click “EDIT”.</li></ul><p>Make easy edits to your property listing, including details, features, media, pricing, and contact information.<br></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n    </article>","seo_title":"Editing existing listings • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":null}}